# CCTV REVIEW SUMMARY — CAM10, PAKWAN/PALWAN CROSS ROAD
**Footage:** cam10.mp4, 60 minutes, 10:30–11:30 (parts covering 10:30–10:54 and subsequent minutes), 28-08-2025

---

## 1. SCENE
Cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a busy mixed-traffic junction carrying cars, two-wheelers, auto-rickshaws, goods vehicles, buses and pedestrians. Footage covers late morning into midday (10:30 onward) in daylight. The road surface appeared damp in places (minutes 13, 19 and later), suggesting recent rain.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
- **Cars:** dozens per minute throughout, predominantly white, plus silver, grey, black, red, maroon, pink and blue.
- **Two-wheelers:** large numbers of motorcycles/scooters, riders mostly helmeted (shirts in white, yellow, pink, red, blue, teal), many with pillions, frequently filtering between lanes; 15–30 at a time in minutes 50–59.
- **Auto-rickshaws:** green-and-yellow throughout; up to 8–10 at a time in parts 2 and 3.
- **Goods vehicles:** "Rudra" box van (m2), grey "LUCKY"/"AJ ABS WRAP" cargo truck (m19), white container truck, tipper and concrete mixer (m21), white Tata truck with red tipper and white Mahindra Bolero-type pickup (m24), 'SHRIGI GOODS CANVAS' truck (m25), red/orange truck with yellow tarpaulin (m33–35), 'PREMIUM EDIBLE'/'RASHI DEWAXED PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS' tempo (m40–42), 'PREMIUM CABLES' canopy truck (m41), white 'GOODS CARRIAGE' box van (m42–45), white Tata and dark blue container trucks (m46), blue three-wheeler goods carriers (m31, 39, 42–44), yellow/orange/beige/blue goods three-wheelers and tarpaulin loads (m50–53), white pickup (m54), white van with roof rack (m55), white goods three-wheeler (m58), white "Jamnagar Transport Co." truck and green "PRINCE" goods three-wheeler (m59).
- **Buses:** white Tata bus GJ30 TA 6194 (m7); yellow Eicher "NIRMA UNIVERSITY" bus and blue/yellow "Where Practice Meets Theory" bus (m24); stationary yellow Nirma University bus (m25–27); red city buses with Gujarati LED displays and 'PFCL'/'ADM 51' markings (m26, 31, 42–45); red bus/heavy vehicle (m25).
- **Agricultural/construction:** red tractor with tanker trailer (m12); red tractor with blue tanker/bowser (m32, 42); tractor with tank/tiller implement (m45); yellow JCB-type construction vehicle (m54).
- **Special:** white SML ambulance-type van with light bar (m0); motorcyclist carrying a gas cylinder (m9); red open-top off-road vehicle (m20, 42–45); green-plate electric white SUV (m20); white Mercedes SUV (m37); police vehicle with red-blue light bar (m49); white police/traffic van GJ18GB8757 (m59); white ambulance crossing top-left (m58).
- **People:** pedestrians crossing or walking the carriageway edge throughout; numerous pedestrians moving between queued vehicles during the jam (see sections 5 and 7).

