## 1. SCENE
The camera overlooks a large signalised urban intersection (Delhi-style, with DTC-style buses, GSRTC and CTU references, and a "DELIGHT P1 RLVD" red-light-enforcement watermark visible from around minute 124 onward). The footage begins at night under artificial streetlighting (20:59), passes through pre-dawn (from ~05:19) and hazy/overcast early-morning daylight, ending at 08:59. The road surface was repeatedly wet/reflective, indicating recent rain or drizzle at numerous points (e.g. minutes 15, 21, 23, 29–32, 50–51, 58, 67, 77, 81, 84, 92, 96, 106, 109, 118, 120, 128, 133, 135, 138, 143, 144, 149, 281 onward, 303, 307, 313, 316–318, 335, 435, 439, 449, 482, 488, 494, 509, 535, 577, 585, 591, 594, 596, 597, 599, 625, 685, 691, 696, 699, 703, 710, 719). Lit shops and a Coca-Cola-branded kiosk/sign (minutes 240, 488, 499) are visible on the right footpath.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
Traffic flowed continuously through all 720 minutes with no alerts. Composition by period:
