- **Late night (mins 175–299):** traffic thinned; 8–25 two-wheelers per minute, 3–6 yellow-green autos per minute, mostly white/silver/black cars, plus trucks (tippers, tarpaulin-covered goods trucks, box trucks, tankers, concrete mixers, container trucks), coaches, a cycle rickshaw (199), a white SUV with blue beacon (175), ambulance-type vans (183, 188, 210, 218, 240, 274, 277), a police vehicle with flashing blue lights (206), a red fire tender (269).
