## 6. CROWD AND CONGESTION
- No traffic jams or stopped-traffic congestion at any point; flow was free-moving throughout.
- Pedestrian crowds on the right footpath near the lit shops: 20+ (minutes 171–174), roughly 20–50 with notable build-ups at minutes 202, 213 and 217, 20–30 at minute 235, 6–10 near white barricades at minute 249, small groups of 3–8 overnight (mins 250–274).
