- **Women and children:** woman in maroon kurti by the bikes (minute 37); woman in red/pink sari (minute 90); woman in red/orange patterned saree working at a shutter base with a companion (minutes 107–114); woman in purple/maroon sari carrying a white sack on her head with a child (minute 131); woman in light green top with dark rucksack (minutes 138–140); woman in white/pale traditional dress (minute 156); woman in white salwar kameez standing by the bollards for the full minute (minute 556); woman in pink top parking a black scooter (minute 168); women on a low wall (minutes 685–687); woman in pink top with bags (minute 696); woman in yellow with child (minute 696); two children among the parked scooters (minutes 379–380); a small child in red/pink standing in the planted area (minute 638).
